#
# Key features:
#   - Relative perturbations for weights, fuzzy values, λ, ν
#   - ν non-negativity enforced
#   - Primary output: mean(WHRI); secondary: std(WHRI) with caveat
#   - Compositional constraint on weights documented
#   - Sobol vs RF reframed as complementary
#   - NaN-safe ranking; exact permutation test for small n
#   - Fuzzy range collapse detection
#   - λ/ν cap-at-boundary warning
# ============================================================

