# PART 8: MONTE CARLO UNCERTAINTY PROPAGATION
# ============================================================
# Watershed Health Resilience Index (WHRI)
# ============================================================
# Propagates uncertainty in weights, fuzzy indicator values, fuzzy
# beta/gamma parameters, and the calibration modifiers (lambda, nu)
# through the WHRI framework.
#
# Key components:
#   - Phase A: global Monte Carlo (distribution of area-mean WHRI)
#   - Phase B: per-pixel uncertainty map (mean, std, CV, P05/P50/P95)
#   - Checkpoint / resume system (auto-invalidation on version bump)
#   - Internal consistency check (rho between mc_mean and WHRI_v7)
# ============================================================

